[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0010","text":"缓解紧张的方法１\n深呼吸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0020","text":"……呼——……\n……哈——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0030","text":"……怎么样？\n羽那，紧张缓解了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0040","text":"嗯——？\n啊哈，好像没什么变化"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0050","text":"我也是～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0060","text":"嗯……\n那接下来是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0070","text":"就是这个……！\n缓解紧张的方法２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0080","text":"在手心里写三遍“人”字，\n然后一口吞下去……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0090","text":"啊，这个经常听说呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_02_0100","text":"“人”、“人”、“人”────"}]
